  "job_B1.4.1_20251001_193227": {
    "chunk_text": "Nu cw\u00e6don \u00fea Mannichei, \u00fea manfullan gedwolan, \u00fe\u00e6t Gode w\u00e6re unwur\u00f0 on his m\u00e6gen\u00ferymnysse Ac gehyre se dysega & se gedwola secgan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t halige m\u00e6den, \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes modor, n\u00e6fde nane Gyf seo sunne scin\u00f0, swa swa we geseo\u00f0 oft, on fulum adelan & heo befyled ne bi\u00f0, micele swi\u00f0or And we sylfe gesawon so\u00f0lice his wuldor, swylc wuldor swa gedafena\u00f0 Godes ancennedan Suna. \u00d0a apostoli gesawon \u00fee si\u00f0edon mid him \u00fea wundra \u00fee he worhte, & hu he wear\u00f0 hwilon uppan anre Eft hi hine gesawon sy\u00f0\u00f0an he of dea\u00f0e aras on ansundum lichaman, & hu he astah to heofonum, & Iohannes se fulluhtere hine gefullode on \u00fe\u00e6re ea iordanen, & Crist \u00fea up eode ut of \u00feam w\u00e6tere & Eft sy\u00f0\u00f0an on \u00feam munte, \u00fea \u00fee him mid w\u00e6ron \u00fea \u00fea he swa beorhte scean, swa swa we s\u00e6don \u00e6r, \u00d0us s\u00e6de Matheus. Eft on \u00feriddan si\u00f0e, \u00e6r Cristes \u00ferowunge, clypode se ylca F\u00e6der cu\u00f0lice him to, \u00fe\u00e6t eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc Nu w\u00e6s \u00feis micel wuldor & micel gewitnyss \u00feam Suna, \u00fe\u00e6t se F\u00e6der swa \u00feriwa \u00feuss clypode him to \u00d0\u00e6t godspell geenda\u00f0 nu on \u00feisum wordum \u00feuss: Eall fulne mid gyfe & mid so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse. On \u00fe\u00e6re menniscnysse he h\u00e6fde swa micele gyfe \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s",
